  "Brick from the sunlit 2019-06 crop of 2143354 (median #795f49 at a 59 degree sun, colour ratio 1 : 0.79 : 0.60) scaled to the overcast 2024-09 crop's lightness (#b0a893 median, blue-cast): #c4946e. White-reference was not usable: the only white paint (door frame) is in the recess shade.",
  "Blue weatherboarding #6a8796 (overcast #547685, sunlit-in-shade #384043, lifted), canopy band light blue #a9d4e4 (sunlit #c3dfe4), door orange-tan #b0785a (overcast #9a846b, sunlit #78503c). Window frames are cream (#e6dfca, kept cream by whiteTrim) with a red-brown mullion the kit cannot colour separately.",
